@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "FAQ";
}
  <!doctype html>
    <html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
        <title>LonelyPartner - Video Chat</title>
        <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/LPLogo.png">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/faq.css" />
        <!-- dont index in google search this page -->
        <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
        <link rel="canonical" href="https://lonelypartner.com" />

    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="faqContainer">
                <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            
            @*General*@
            <div class="itemType">
                <h3>General</h3>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                            <span class="faq-title">What is LonelyPartner?</span>
                            <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p>
                                LonelyPartner is an ADULT video cam roulette chat. To provide a platform 
                                for like minded people to meet online through webcam and internet.
                                 
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                            <span class="faq-title">Is LonelyPartner anonymous?</span>
                            <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p>
                                Yes, LonelyPartner is completely anonymous. LonelyPartner does not store 
                                any personal data except the gmail Id for signin.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                            <span class="faq-title">Is LonelyPartner free?</span>
                            <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p>
                                Yes, LonelyPartner's basic features are free to use, by just clicking "Start" button.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                            <span class="faq-title">Who uses LonelyPartner?</span>
                            <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p>
                                LonelyPartner is an adult video chat roulette. As long as user/you are over 18 years
                                old.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                            <span class="faq-title">Should I have web camera?</span>
                            <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p>
                                Not, you need not have web camera. when you do not have web camera you will get connected
                                to other users who have webcamera  and expect that you have web camera, and since LonelyPartner
                                is roulette chat, the probability of getting connected is less.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                            <span class="faq-title">How do I report a bug or provide feedback?</span>
                            <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p>
                                You can use menu option at the top right corner and select "Contact Us", fill the form to send.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>


            </div>
            @*How to use*@
            <div class="itemType">
                <h3>How to use</h3>
                    
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Why does it say “Allow” on my screen?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    When you first connect to the LonelyPartner platform, you are asked to allow the service
                                    to access your webcamera. Allowing your webcamera, lets other people on the chat see your
                                    live broadcast.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">What is "Start" button?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    To start webcamera chat roulette, you need to click "Start" button. to meet like minded user.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">What is "Start" button?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    To start webcamera chat roulette, you need to click "Start" button. to meet like minded user.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Why should I select "I Am" drop down?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    You need to select "I Am", so other users know which gender you automatically, 
                                    to increase the probability of finding a like minded user.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">What is "Next" button?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    Say, you are in chat with other user, later you do not find other user like minded,
                                    just click "Next", to find another like minded user.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">What is "Looking For" button?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    If you want to find a user with specifc gender you can click "Looking For" button,
                                    It is a premium service.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">What is "All Continents" button?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    If you want to find a user from a specifc continent you can click "All Continents" button,
                                    It is a premium service.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">What is "Login" button?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    LonelyPartner is an anonymous video chat roulette platform, which does not
                                    have sign-up, only sign-in using gmail account.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Do I need to have Gmail account?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    Yes, LonelyPartner, as of today uses only Gmail sign-in.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Can I share personal information?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    LonelyPartner recommends not to share personal information. You can choose
                                    to share your personal information during the chat.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
            </div>

             @*Device*@
            <div class="itemType">
                <h3>Device</h3>
                    
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Which device can I use?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    You can use desktop , loptop or mobile, to use LonelyPartner platform.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Which browser do I use?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    LonelyPartner recommends you to use chrome browser, to have hassle free
                                    user experience.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
            </div>

             @*Payment*@
            <div class="itemType">
                <h3>Payment</h3>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">How does Payment work?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    LonelyPartner is anonymous video chat platform, using cryto payment, makes LonelyPartner
                                    complete anonymous. It works like this,  there are many ways, the simplest is described
                                    here: you buy Solana crypto using centralized exchange like WarirX , Kucoin, Coinbase,
                                    Gate.io, etc , from centralized exchange send Solana to your Solana Address in your 
                                    Phantom Wallet, Phantom is a decentralized exchange, when you use Pay button in
                                    LonelyPartner or scan QR code in LonelyPartner, you pay using Solana crypto to get premium 
                                    access. The point where the payment process reaches your Phantom wallete, you become 
                                    complete anonymous.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    
                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Can I use only Crypto Payment?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    Yes,LonelyPartner is an anonymous video chat roullete, to keep user
                                    anonymous, LonelyPartner chose crypto payment. Crypto is complete anonymous,
                                    when decentralized exchange is used.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Why only Phantom Wallet?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    Phantom Wallet is easy to use, user friendly, Solana crypto's native wallet.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Why only Solana crypto?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    Solana has the lowest fees and fastest trasaction per second. Easy to use when 
                                    transaction is using Phantom Wallet.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">I used QR code while payment, but I do not see premium service enabled?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    When you use QR code and make the payment for premium service, you need to get the 
                                    signature from Solscan.com. You can go to Phantom wallet > select "Solana" under Tokens >
                                    scroll to the bottom, you will see the transacion under "Activity", Click the transaction >
                                    click "View on Orb" > browser opens, showing you transaction details , copy "Signature".
                                    Come to LonelyPartner > Profile > paste the signature in "Payment Verification" and click "Verify Payment".
                                    LonelyPartner will verify the payment and activate premium service.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">When in Phantom Wallet connecting to LonelyPartner for first time?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    If you do not have enough Solana balance in your phantom wallet and you try to pay,
                                    you will see a screen in phantom wallet, saying "unsafe" , this is default behaviour
                                    of phantom wallet, if not enough solana balance exists in your wallet, the message 
                                    in phantom wallet is misleading.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">From desktop/laptop I clicked "Pay x.xxxxSOL" button for payment?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    From desktop is straight forward and easy. You will be asked to install Phantom wallet if not not installed already.
                                    Then you will be asked to give connect to LonelyPartner website, once you give permisson to connect,
                                    you will be asked to sign the transaction, meaning you are making the payment. LonelyPartner
                                    will verify the payment and enable premium services immediately.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">From Mobile I clicked "Pay x.xxxxSOL" button for payment?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    From mobile, payment needs few actions from you. You will be asked to install Phantom wallet if not not installed already.
                                    You will be shown a pop-up, and a button to copy the url, Click the copy the url. Open Phantom Wallet,
                                    at bottom right corner you will see phantom's in-app browser( magnifing glass icon), click it, it open a new screen, which is
                                    Phantom's in-app broswer, past the url you copied from LonelyPartner's platform, it will open lonelypartner's page with pay button "Send SOL with Phantom",
                                    click the button.Then you will be asked to give connect to LonelyPartner website, once you give permisson to connect,
                                    you will be asked to sign the transaction, meaning you are making the payment. A pop-up is shown with transaction signature, 
                                    copy the signature, come back to LonelyPartner, where the platform is waiting for you to paste the signature. Paste the signature and click verify button. LonelyPartner
                                    will verify the payment and enable premium services immediately.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="faq-item">
                            <div class="faq-header" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                                <span class="faq-title">Why is Mobile payment, not straight forward?</span>
                                <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="faq-content">
                                <p>
                                    From mobile, payment needs few user action, because Phatom Wallet deprecated mobile access programactically.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
            </div>

        </div>

             @*=============Script==========*@
                <script>
                    function toggleFaq(header) {
                        const item = header.parentElement;
                        item.classList.toggle("open");
                    }
                </script>

    </body>
</html>

